==German==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/mɔlç/|lang=de}}

===Etymology===
From an alteration (''-ch'' due to {{term|Lurch|lang=de}}) of {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|mol|lang=gmh}}, {{term|molle|lang=gmh}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|mol|lang=goh}}, {{term|molo|lang=goh}}, {{term|mollo|mollo|newt, salamander, lizard|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{recons|mulaz|lang=gem-pro}}, {{recons|mulhaz|lang=gem-pro}}, {{recons|mulô||mole, salamander|lang=gem-pro}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{recons|molk-|lang=ine-pro}}, {{recons|molg-||slug, salamander|lang=ine-pro}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{recons|melh₂-||to mill, grind|lang=ine-pro}}. More at {{l|en|mole}}.

